; Installer languages: Simplified Chinese and English.

!insertmacro MUI_LANGUAGE "SimpChinese"
!insertmacro MUI_LANGUAGE "English"

LangString CageDirectoryHelp ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "选择 Cage 的安装目录。"
LangString CageShortcutsTitle ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "快捷方式"
LangString CageShortcutsHelp ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "选择要添加的快捷方式。"
LangString CageDesktopShortcut ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "添加桌面快捷方式"
LangString CageStartMenuShortcuts ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "添加到开始菜单"
LangString CageFinishHelp ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "Cage 已安装。"
LangString CageSetupArch ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "此安装包需要 Intel 或 AMD 的 64 位 Windows。ARM 和 32 位 Windows 暂不支持。"
LangString CageSetupWindows ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "Cage 需要 Windows 10 22H2（版本 19045）或 Windows 11。请更新 Windows 后重试。"
LangString CageSetupStop ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "请退出 Cage 并停止环境，再安装或卸载。"
LangString CageSetupDedicated ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "请选择专用于此应用的文件夹。"
LangString CageSetupOtherFiles ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "目标文件夹包含其他安装的文件。请选择空文件夹。"
LangString CageSetupUnpack ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法解压 Cage。请检查剩余空间和文件夹权限。"
LangString CageSetupWebView ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "正在安装随附的 Microsoft WebView2 运行时…"
LangString CageSetupWebViewError ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "Microsoft WebView2 安装失败（$0）。请安装该运行时后重试。"
LangString CageSetupBusyFiles ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法移动已安装的应用。请退出 Cage，关闭正在使用安装目录文件的程序，然后重试。"
LangString CageSetupRestore ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法安装 Cage。已恢复原安装。"
LangString CageSetupIdentity ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "所选文件夹缺少 Cage 安装标记。"
LangString CageSetupDetail0 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法锁定 Cage 安装操作，请核对系统权限后重试。"
LangString CageSetupDetail1 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "另一个 Cage 安装或卸载仍在进行，请等待完成后重试。"
LangString CageSetupDetail2 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "安装恢复尚未完成。文件分别保留在 $BackupDir 和 $StageDir，请保留这两个目录后重试。"
LangString CageSetupDetail3 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "原安装目录未能恢复。文件保留在 $BackupDir，新程序保留在 $StageDir。"
LangString CageSetupDetail4 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "仍有文件需要核对，安装回执保留在 $TransactionRecord。请保留相关目录后处理。"
LangString CageSetupDetail5 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "存在未处理的安装事务记录：$TransactionRecord。请先按记录恢复保留的目录，再重试。"
LangString CageSetupDetail6 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "正在检查并保留已有项目和修改文件…"
LangString CageSetupDetail7 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法安全保留现有文件，安装已停止。原安装目录已保留，请检查磁盘空间、文件占用和安装日志。"
LangString CageSetupDetail8 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "正在迁入个人文件并保留原有链接…"
LangString CageSetupDetail9 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "个人文件未能迁入新程序目录，原安装已恢复。请关闭占用文件的程序后重试。"
LangString CageSetupDetail10 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "正在清理已核对的旧程序文件…"
LangString CageSetupDetail11 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "旧目录中仍有需要保留的文件：$BackupDir"
LangString CageSetupDetail12 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "安装仍有待恢复的文件。请保留 $TransactionRecord 及其中记录的目录，再处理恢复。"
LangString CageSetupDetail13 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "安装回执未能完成，记录保留在 $TransactionRecord。"
LangString CageSetupDetail14 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "存在待恢复的安装事务，请先处理 $INSTDIR.cage-installation.json 中记录的目录。"
LangString CageSetupDetail15 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "部分程序文件正在使用或无法读取，卸载未完成。个人文件已保留，请关闭占用程序后重试。"

LangString CageDirectoryHelp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose where to install Cage."
LangString CageShortcutsTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Shortcuts"
LangString CageShortcutsHelp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose shortcuts to add."
LangString CageDesktopShortcut ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Add desktop shortcut"
LangString CageStartMenuShortcuts ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Add to Start menu"
LangString CageFinishHelp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Cage is installed."
LangString CageSetupArch ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This installer needs 64-bit Windows on Intel or AMD. ARM and 32-bit Windows aren't supported yet."
LangString CageSetupWindows ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Cage needs Windows 10 22H2 (build 19045) or Windows 11. Update Windows and try again."
LangString CageSetupStop ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Quit Cage and stop the environment before installing or uninstalling."
LangString CageSetupDedicated ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose a folder dedicated to this app."
LangString CageSetupOtherFiles ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The destination folder contains files from another installation. Choose an empty folder."
LangString CageSetupUnpack ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Couldn't unpack Cage. Check free space and folder permissions."
LangString CageSetupWebView ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing the bundled Microsoft WebView2 runtime…"
LangString CageSetupWebViewError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Microsoft WebView2 installation failed ($0). Install the runtime and try again."
LangString CageSetupBusyFiles ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Couldn't move the installed app. Quit Cage, close programs using files in the install folder, then try again."
LangString CageSetupRestore ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Couldn't install Cage. The previous installation was restored."
LangString CageSetupIdentity ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The selected folder is missing the Cage install marker."
LangString CageSetupDetail0 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Couldn't lock the Cage install operation. Check system permissions and try again."
LangString CageSetupDetail1 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Another Cage install or uninstall is in progress. Wait for it to finish and try again."
LangString CageSetupDetail2 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Install recovery isn't finished. Files are kept in $BackupDir and $StageDir; keep both folders and try again."
LangString CageSetupDetail3 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The original install folder couldn't be restored. Files are kept in $BackupDir and the new program in $StageDir."
LangString CageSetupDetail4 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Some files still need checking; the install record is kept in $TransactionRecord. Keep the related folders before continuing."
LangString CageSetupDetail5 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "An unprocessed install transaction record exists: $TransactionRecord. Restore the kept folders from it first, then try again."
LangString CageSetupDetail6 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Checking and keeping existing projects and modified files…"
LangString CageSetupDetail7 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Couldn't safely keep existing files; installation stopped. The original install folder is kept. Check disk space, files in use and the install log."
LangString CageSetupDetail8 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Moving personal files in and keeping existing links…"
LangString CageSetupDetail9 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Personal files couldn't be moved to the new program folder; the original installation was restored. Close programs using the files and try again."
LangString CageSetupDetail10 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Cleaning up verified old program files…"
LangString CageSetupDetail11 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The old folder still has files to keep: $BackupDir"
LangString CageSetupDetail12 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The installation still has files to recover. Keep $TransactionRecord and the folders it lists before recovering."
LangString CageSetupDetail13 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The install record couldn't be completed; it's kept in $TransactionRecord."
LangString CageSetupDetail14 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "An install transaction is pending recovery. First handle the folders recorded in $INSTDIR.cage-installation.json."
LangString CageSetupDetail15 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Some program files are in use or unreadable; uninstall didn't finish. Personal files are kept. Close the programs using them and try again."

LangString CageInstallerLanguage ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "安装语言"
LangString CageInstallerLanguage ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installer language"
